Output assets/postil-preview.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set Width 1100
Set Height 720
Set FontSize 18
Set Framerate 30
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Frappe"
Set Padding 16

Hide
Type "nvim --clean -u demo/preview.lua demo/example.lua"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show
Sleep 1s

Type "5G"
Sleep 500ms
Type "V5j"
Sleep 1s
Type " ap"
Sleep 1s

Type "Explain why this lock ordering can deadlock."
Enter
Type "Suggest a safer locking strategy."
Sleep 1s
Escape
Type ":w"
Enter
Sleep 4s
